  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ABANDI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ABANDI (act as you do for others) activity will increase access to comprehensive HIV prevention, care, and treatment services, and strengthen systems for planning, monitoring, evaluating, and assure the quality of services along the prevention-to-care continuum for men who have sex with men (MSM) and transgender individuals (TG).</narrative>
  </description>
